:36},{"text":"찾으면","x":1758,"y":1627,"width":94,"height":39}]},{"text":"서비스 순서에서 다음 클래스로 즉시 이동한다.","words":[{"text":"서비스","x":538,"y":1693,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"순서에서","x":651,"y":1693,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"다음","x":800,"y":1693,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"클래스로","x":878,"y":1691,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"즉시","x":1025,"y":1692,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"이동한다.","x":1106,"y":1690,"width":138,"height":40}]},{"text":"WFQ는 각 클래스마다 다른 양의 서비스 시간을 부여 받는다는 점에서 라운드 로","words":[{"text":"WFQ는","x":603,"y":1757,"width":122,"height":38},{"text":"각","x":737,"y":1755,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"클래스마다","x":784,"y":1754,"width":168,"height":39},{"text":"다른","x":965,"y":1753,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"양의","x":1046,"y":1754,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"서비스","x":1125,"y":1753,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"시간을","x":1237,"y":1751,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"부여","x":1351,"y":1752,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"받는다는","x":1435,"y":1752,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"점에서","x":1589,"y":1751,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"라운드","x":1710,"y":1750,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"로","x":1824,"y":1755,"width":29,"height":29}]},{"text":"빈과 차이가 있다. 특히 각 클래스 가중치(weight) 바를 할당받는다. WFQ에서는","words":[{"text":"빈과","x":540,"y":1815,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"차이가","x":620,"y":1816,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":739,"y":1816,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"특히","x":829,"y":1816,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"각","x":911,"y":1816,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"클래스","x":958,"y":1816,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"가중치(weight)","x":1134,"y":1814,"width":229,"height":41},{"text":"바를","x":1380,"y":1815,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"할당받는다.","x":1463,"y":1813,"width":184,"height":39},{"text":"WFQ에서는","x":1666,"y":1812,"width":188,"height":41}]},{"text":"전송할 클래스 i 패킷이 있는 동안에 클래스 i는 wt/(EWJ)의 서비스 시간을 보장받으며,","words":[{"text":"전송할","x":538,"y":1878,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"클래스","x":650,"y":1879,"width":102,"heigh