WJ)만큼을","x":1530,"y":2000,"width":248,"height":46},{"text":"사용","x":1792,"y":2000,"width":63,"height":38}]},{"text":"할 수 있도록 보장받는다. 최악의 경우 분모는 모든 클래스의 합이다. 따라서 전송뤁 R","words":[{"text":"할","x":537,"y":2060,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":584,"y":2059,"width":33,"height":38},{"text":"있도록","x":632,"y":2059,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"보장받는다.","x":745,"y":2060,"width":174,"height":38},{"text":"최악의","x":937,"y":2060,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"경우","x":1049,"y":2061,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"분모는","x":1126,"y":2061,"width":102,"height":36},{"text":"모든","x":1240,"y":2063,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"클래스의","x":1321,"y":2062,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"합이다.","x":1471,"y":2061,"width":112,"height":39},{"text":"따라서","x":1601,"y":2061,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"전송뤁","x":1724,"y":2060,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"R","x":1834,"y":2065,"width":21,"height":28}]},{"text":"인 링그에 대해 클래스 i는 항상 최소한 R • WI/(EWJ)의 처리율을 가진다. 여기서 설명","words":[{"text":"인","x":540,"y":2122,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"링그에","x":587,"y":2122,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"대해","x":702,"y":2123,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"클래스","x":781,"y":2123,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"i는","x":894,"y":2125,"width":45,"height":35},{"text":"항상","x":952,"y":2123,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"최소한","x":1033,"y":2123,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"R","x":1143,"y":2128,"width":23,"height":29},{"text":"•","x":1183,"y":2140,"width":6,"height":7},{"text":"WI/(EWJ)의","x":1206,"y":2124,"width":166,"height":46},{"text":"처리율을","x":1392,"y":2125,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"가진다.","x":1542,"y":2125,"width":114,"height":38},{"text":"여기서","x":1675,"y":2123,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"설명","x":1794,"y":2123,"width":58,"height":39}]},{"text":"한 WFQ는 이상적인 것인데, 그 이우는 패것이 이산적인 단위 데이터라는 것과 한 패","words":[{"text":"한","x":538,"y":2182,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"WFQ는","x":585,"y":2185,"width":123,"height":37},{"text":"이상적인","x":722,"y":2182,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"